{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03104","headline":"故徐州刺史赠吏部侍郎苏公挽歌词三首 二 · 张九龄","name":"故徐州刺史赠吏部侍郎苏公挽歌词三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相如只谢病，子敬忽云亡。\n岂悟瑶台雪，分雕玉树行。\n清规留草议，故事在封章。\n本谓山公啓，而今殁始扬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03104.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03104","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}